utation a defined serialization order (a disable blocked behind an in-flight mutation applies the moment it commits, and no further tick claims; a disable that commits first makes the mutation return zero rows, no write, no event, and the runner completes the wakeup as `error`). This is what makes the kill switch's "no terminal mutation after disable" a statement-level guarantee rather than a racing check. Also reuses the two-tier domain router, `logAction` — **which gains the `agent_loop.action` event emission here (Tier 1: the `agent_loop_action_log` insert + event batched), with the loop's inline `recordAgentLoopActivityEvent` call site cut over to the activity consumer through the standard per-kind sequence in this train** (no later phase may delete an inline writer whose kind never got a cutover) — and `storeActionMemory`. Budgets per Decision 7. Inference via the loop-surface minimal resolver this chunk implements outright (C7's full resolver, landing after a4, replaces the shim — the supersession table note). `runAgentLoopBatch` becomes the degraded wrapper: idle-sweep + run due wakeups up to the old batch size.
